window.products.push({"id":118063,"name":"30\" SS RANGE HOOD (Broan-Nutone NW3004)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413SbpC-gfL._AC_.jpg","description":"Powerful 2-speed mixed flow fan for efficient air movement. Rocker switches for convenient fingertip control of light and fan. Easy-to-clean baked on acrylic enamel finish. 75W capacity lamp with unbreakable light diffusing lens. Height: 6\". Fits cabinets 12\" deep or more. Exclusive multi-layer design, Microtek duct-free filter traps solid cooking contaminates before air is recirculated into kitchen. For maximum filtration, replace filter every 6 months. Uses replacement filter model No. 41F. No. NW3001: 30\" width, white No. NW3002: 30\" width, biscuit No. NW3008: 30\" width, almond No. NW3004: 30\" width, stainless steel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413SbpC-gfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan","source_asin":"B000LNM40U","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000LNM40U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B000LNM40U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":118064,"name":"GYNSCO Coffee Capsule, Stainless Steel Reusable Vertuo Pods - Refillable Vertuoline Capsules Compatible with Nespresso Vertuoline GCA1, Delonghi ENV13","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yPPznGDCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎇Lead a cost-saving and green life. ONE FOR ALL: Save Your Money and the Environment using the coffee you like. 🎇 PACKAGE INCLUDES – 1 Stainless Steel Refillable Coffee Pod, 1 Coffee Spoon, 1 Cleaning brush, 2 extra Silicone rings, 2 extra Barcodes🎇 SIZES: 230ml (7.7oz) and 80ml (2.5oz). 🎇Fit for: - NESPRESSO vertuoline GCA1 - Delonghi ENV135 - Delonghi ENV150 - Vertuoplus. 🎇 Not compatible with Nespresso Vertuo Next machine! 🎇HOW TO USE: The reusable Stainless-steel capsules are very easy to manage, it may take a bit more time than the original Nespresso vertuo pods, but totally worth it saving your money, enjoying any flavor of coffee desired, and best of all, saving the planet. First thing to do is choose your coffee grounds, this will be key in acquiring your desired concentration for your coffee. Please fill fresh medium or dark roasted *FINE* grounds into it. Start filling up the capsule, you can use two or two and a half scoops for the 80ml (2.5oz) and three and a half or four scoops for the 230ml (7.7oz), for every scoop press it lightly, so you can tamper the coffee, if you have a tamper is better but if you don’t you can use the coffee spoon that comes in the set, so each scoop + tamp, and again, next scoop + tamp again over and over until you fill with grinded coffee nearly to the top of container Screw it on tight to avoid any leaking. and put into your Nespresso brewer to enjoy a cup with a layer of crema and espresso flavor. After your coffee is ready please WAIT until you clean your coffee capsule, it’s made of stainless steel and will be VERY HOT after the use. After the capsule has cooled down you can unscrew it and handwash it. It’s not dishwasher safe so you need to handwash it. Our capsule works with fine, medium coarse, coarse ground coffee, and medium or dark roast, we do recommend fine and dark roast though, to get coffee strength.🎇Coffee Recommendation *Espresso size coffee 80ml (2.5oz)* Although our coffee capsule operates on its best to ensure good quality, aroma, flavor, strength and crema similar to the original vertuo pods, the 230ml capsules can be a little less concentrated in flavor compared to the original Nespresso pod. The 80ml capsule reaches the closest to the original pods flavor, strength, and crema. 🎇 The silicone ring prevents leaks during brewing. Replace when it becomes loose. 🎇 CUSTOMER SERVICE – We value each customer and your experience with our product. If you need any help managing our product or if you need any support, please contact us at: gynscostore@gmail.com. DISCLAIMER: Nespresso and its logo is a registered trade mark owned by Société des Produits Nestlé SA. Brand name and references of machine models are made with the purpose of indicating our product's compatibility. Our brand is not associated with the above company.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yPPznGDCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BY3KTJ4Z","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY3KTJ4Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY3KTJ4Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
