window.products.push({"id":118167,"name":"14' Quick Snap Cleaning Kit with Drill Attachment for Dryer Hose and Vent Duct Cleaning - Ziggurat Products","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ChRJ5PKYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLIFY YOUR DRYER VENT CLEANING: It’s recommended to clean your clothes dryer at least once annually. This can be a tedious process, but with the Snap To Vent Dryer Cleaner, dryer cleaning has never been easier. Our extendable cleaning rods can clean not just your hose, but dryer ventilation system as well. ULTRA LONG SNAP-RODS: Our cleaning kit comes with 10, 17 inch rods that allow you to extend your cleaning kit up to 14 feet long. This means that cleaning your entire dryer ducting is painless because there’s no place out of reach. PREMIUM QUICK SNAP COMPONENTS: We work hard to ensure our products ship with top quality material. Every piece of your cleaning kit is extremely durable and effective, from the nylon brush to the quick snap connectors. You can rest assured your product will be top industry standard. DRILL CONNECTOR: Playing chimney sweep by hand with a dryer can be tiring and tedious. That’s why our cleaning kit comes with a drill attachment, which allows you to spin the brush automatically. Your dryer vent cleaning has never been so easy or so thorough. ENERGY EFFICIENT, COST EFFECTIVE: Many people will skip their annual dryer cleaning because of how tedious it can be, but with your cleaning kit, the annual cleaning has never been easier. The long term effects are lower energy consumption making your dryer dry faster while decreasing your power bill.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ChRJ5PKYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZIGGURAT PRODUCTS","source_asin":"B08542CL8K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08542CL8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08542CL8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
