window.products.push({"id":118174,"name":"Oline Ice Maker Machine, Automatic Self-Cleaning Portable Electric Countertop Ice Maker, 26 Pounds in 24 Hours, 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 7 Minutes, with I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+0PJIOljL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"RATED THE #1 ICE MAKER: Quench your thirst on those warm days with an icy-cold drink, a sweet slushy, or a workout smoothie. This stylish ice maker is your go-to kitchen appliance for when you’re thirsty, need to reduce injury’s swelling, or for chilling your produce, dairy, desserts, or meat. SO COOL: This modern-looking ice machine is so cool, literally. It features a control panel and touchpad, and an ice shovel for easy scooping. There’s also an ice basket which is great for transporting and storing ice. This comes in handy when you’re tired of using freezer ice trays. EASY START: With a touch of the SELECT button, this easy-to-use ice making machine makes ice in no time (around 6-13 minutes). Simply choose your ice size of choice, open the upper cover and remove the basket. Add water to the tank, put it back, close the cover, and push ON. COUNTERTOP READY: This countertop ice maker fits perfectly onto your kitchen counter next to all of your most-used appliances. It can also be used with your wet bar, in your RV, in the office or poolside, and when you’re entertaining and hosting parties both indoors and outdoors. CLEAN MACHINE: Keep your portable ice maker clean by removing the ice basket and opening the drain plug and drying the water tank. Using a soft cloth, along with some warm water and diluted detergent, wipe the water tank clean. The same can be done for the outer machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+0PJIOljL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oline","source_asin":"B0986CZMP6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0986CZMP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0986CZMP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
