window.products.push({"id":118183,"name":"5221ER1003A 5220FR2006H Washer Water Inlet Valve (OEM Part) by Beaquicy - Replacement for Ken-more L-G Washing Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712+SQKX1LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 𝑺𝑼𝑷𝑷𝑶𝑹𝑻 𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑹𝑬𝑻𝑼𝑹𝑵 & 𝑬𝑿𝑪𝑯𝑨𝑵𝑮𝑬- 𝑹𝑰𝑺𝑲-𝑭𝑹𝑬𝑬 𝑺𝑯𝑶𝑷𝑷𝑰𝑵𝑮. Beaquicy attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. 𝑰𝑫𝑬𝑨𝑳 𝑹𝑬𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑪𝑬𝑴𝑬𝑵𝑻---◆5221ER1003A Washing Machine Water Inlet Valve can control the flow of water into the washing machine. There are one inlet (standard hose fitting) and 3 outlets (2 of the outlets face 45 degrees to the right, one outlet faces 45 degrees to the left). This valve is used for cold water fill and pre-wash.◆5220FR2006H Washing Machine Water Inlet Valve for Hot Water controls the water flow into the washer. This inter valve has a standard hose fitting inlet and one water outlet. 𝑶𝑬𝑴 𝑼𝑷𝑮𝑹𝑨𝑫𝑬 𝑰𝑴𝑷𝑹𝑶𝑽𝑬𝑫---The package includes 1 x 5221ER1003A Cold Water Inlet Valve, 1 x 5220FR2006H Washer Hot Water Inlet Valve. They are made of durable high-quality materials, well tested by the manufacturer, upgraded and improved on the basis of the OEM, and added metal strainer to the inlet of hose fittings. The standard hose fitting of 5221ER1003A is changed to yellow for better distinction and the main body is in aquamarine blue. The main body of 5220FR2006H is in turquoise green. 𝑾𝑰𝑫𝑬 𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑳𝑬---5221ER1003A Washer Water Inlet Valve and 5220FR2006H Washer Water Inlet Valve for Hot Water can fit for Ken-more, L-G washing machine. ★5221ER1003A Replaces Parts#5221ER1003C, 5221ER1003D, 1268130, AP4442608, PS3527452,EAP3527452.★5220FR2006H Replaces Parts#5220FR2006L, 5220FR2006Q,1268123,AP4441935,PS3527427,EAP3527427.✦FIT MODELS: 79641262610,79641302610,79641383411,41072,41073,41162,F3E0CYT2W,F3G2CNT3W,F3G2CNT4W,79641728000,79640272800,79640021900. 𝑴𝒐𝒓𝒆 𝒄𝒐𝒎𝒑𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒃𝒍𝒆 𝒎𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔 𝒂𝒓𝒆 𝒍𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒆𝒅 𝒊𝒏 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝒅𝒆𝒔𝒄𝒓𝒊𝒑𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏. 𝑬𝑨𝑺𝒀 𝑻𝑶 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑳𝑳---Before installing 5221ER1003A Cold Water Inlet Valve and 5220FR2006H Washer Hot Water Inlet Valve, you should prepare a Philips screwdriver, small flathead screwdriver, bucket or small container, towel, pliers, and vice grips. Following the online repair video is the easiest way to ensure the correct installation of the drainage pump. DIY installation not only saves money on hiring a repairman, but also on replacing your washing machine. Very cost-effective!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712+SQKX1LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B09CYPYFDJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CYPYFDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CYPYFDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
