window.products.push({"id":118382,"name":"36 Inch Induction Cooktop 5 Boost Burners, Built-in Electric Stove Top Cooker with Double Flexi Zone, 9 Power Levels, Keep Warm Function, Timer, Child","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":449.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HDMdAjwvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flexible BBQ Function - Flexible zones consist of 2 independent sensors that can work together as one large cooking space for any large or long pot for grilling. It can also be used as a single zone, and the four single zones on either side can be converted to two large single zones for your more varied cooking needs. Powerful Cooking Zones - This 36\" induction cooktop has 5 cooking zones, with four cooking zones on either side as free zones. The total power is 9000W. The left double burner has a maximum power of 2800W/2000W, the right double burner has a maximum power of 2000W/2800W and the center cross burner has a maximum power of 3000W. This high power induction cooktop saves your cooking time. Easy to Control - The built-in digital sensor touch space allows you to control your induction cooktop with the touch of a finger. Each cooking zone of this induction cooktop has 9 power levels and a 99-minute timer. Giving you better control over cooking temperature and cooking time. Easy to Clean - To get the best out of your induction cooktop, simply wipe it with a soft cloth after use and it will be as good as new. Make sure the heating indicator is off and the hob is cool to the touch. Multiple Protection Features - Over heating protection, auto shut-off protection, and child lock function prevents unintended activation, ensuring safety for your whole family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HDMdAjwvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"singlehomie","source_asin":"B09HBSSX3D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HBSSX3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HBSSX3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
