window.products.push({"id":118453,"name":"Chorreador,Costa Rican Handmade Portable Foldable Wooden Stand Coffee Maker,Included:1 Large Reusable Cloth Filter(Bolsa de Chorrear Cafe),Model:Blue ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+EZlwbesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple and easy to use: Place the cloth filter inside the opening of the Chorreador. -Add your favorite coffee grind inside the cloth filter -Pour boiling water slowly, the amount of water added should be in accordance with the coffee strength you want to make. This Chorreador folds to 11.75 x 4.75 x 0.75 inches. Full size when standing and making coffee is 11.75 x 5.5 x 5.75 inches. Cleaning and maintaining: -Rinse the cloth filter in warm water after each use. -Allow the cloth filter to dry between uses. Warning: DO NOT use any kind of soap or detergent to clean the cloth filter, because it will leave undesirable taste in the cloth material which will be transferred to the brewed coffee as well. Alternatively you can clean the cloth filter by rubbing it in salt and rinsing it in warm water every once in a while. Note: It is normal for the cloth filter to get stained and change its color to dark brown after a few uses due to the oils that get released from the coffee grinds during the brewing process, That will not affect the function of the cloth filter nor the taste of the brewed coffee in any negative way. On the contrary, traditionally it's believed that the longer a cloth filter has been used to brew coffee the better the taste of the coffee will get. Included cloth filter (Chorrear/Bolsa) Size: Large: 7\"x4\"x0.25\",","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+EZlwbesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Love Gourmet Coffee","source_asin":"B079SS3594","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079SS3594","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B079SS3594","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
