window.products.push({"id":118599,"name":"OKADA Portable Ice Maker Countertop - 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 6 Mins - Makes 26 lbs Ice in 24 hrs - Electric Ice Making Machine with Basket and Ice Scoop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ax0kSalJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUIET & QUICKLY MAKE ICE IN 6 MINUTES - The ice making machine can produce up to 26 pounds of ice per 24 hrs and you can get 9 bullet-shape ice cubes within just 6 to 13 minutes. You won't have to deal with ice trays ever again. It stores up to 1.6 pounds of ice at a time in its insulated storage bin. Running at only 39 decibels, you can enjoy fresh ice cubes without bearing too much noise. TWO TYPES OF CLEANING METHODS - This portable ice maker features a built-in self-cleaning function for daily ease and quick clean, you just press the ON/OFF button for 6 seconds to perform the cleaning mode. Also,fully-open design of the lid allowing it more thorough and easy to clean by manual. Regular cleaning leads to elongate the lifetime of the ice maker and avoid the ice cubes becoming smaller and cloudy. COMPACT & PORTABLE ICE MAKER - With a dimension of 9.5 x 13.9 x 14in, this countertop ice maker unit is small enough to move on and off the counter. It is compact, portable and will work anywhere there is a standard electrical outlet to plug it into. It doesn't need a water line or drain line, making it useful for boat, small kitchen, restraunts, bars, office, and more. SMART INDICATOR & TWO ICE SIZE OPTIONS - This ice maker unit automatically lights related indicator and stops working when the ice basket is full or when there is a need to add water. Meanwhile, you can select small or large ice cube size depending on your own preference. Bullet-shape ice cube is hollow in the middle, which allows it to melt more quickly and great for chewing. ADVANCED CUSTOMER SERVICE - Basket and ice scoop are included for easy serving. Our Countertop Portable Ice Maker is covered with a one year for worry free. It's made from food-grade materials to provide you with healthy and safe ice cubes. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions about our countertop ice make. Our technical advice and local customer service are provided throughout life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ax0kSalJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloud Mountain","source_asin":"B095NZNVCC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095NZNVCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B095NZNVCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
