window.products.push({"id":118658,"name":"Humbree Ceramic Coffee Dripper | Non Electric Pour Over Coffee Maker | For No. 2 or 4 Filters | Simple & Easy To Use Brewer | Straight To Cup or Pot D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vaTPBDkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How would you like to enjoy café-level drip brewed coffee right at the comfort of your own home? We get it. Hanging out at cafes can be a nice, relaxing experience for any true-blue coffee lover. Whether it’s for your morning cup of joe, an afternoon pick-me-up or something to keep you alert on the commute home, you just can’t go a day without passing by your local coffee joint. Unfortunately, this habit can get pretty expensive fast. Imagine how much money you’ll be able to save if you didn’t have to spend so much on overpriced coffee every single day. Get your pro-quality pour over coffee fix for the perfect coffee, every single time with the Humbree Ceramic Coffee Dripper! There’s nothing like a pour over coffee maker to get that beautiful aroma of freshly brewed coffee in your home. Expertly crafted with premium-quality 100% food-grade ceramic, each coffee dripper we put out is fitted with two small holes on the bottom to promote optimum water-to-coffee contact. The result is finest café-quality drip coffee every single time. Designed portable for the modern coffee-drinker, just get your favorite ground coffee and easily make your own pour over coffee anywhere. Our product is also specifically crafter to fit most standard-sized teapots and mugs so you don’t have to worry about buying additional equipment to make it work. Thanks to its open-base design, you can check the level of the mug or pot underneath without moving it. More reasons why coffee lovers can’t get enough of our coffee dripper:  ✅ Minimalist yet elegant design to complement any kitchen. ✅ Maintain complete control of your pour over brewing experience. ✅ 100% safe for use with dishwashers so you can just throw it in after use. Give yourself the gift of a perfect café-quality pour over coffee! Add the Humbree Ceramic Coffee Dripper to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vaTPBDkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Humbree","source_asin":"B07CVKKXWJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CVKKXWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CVKKXWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
