window.products.push({"id":118676,"name":"ICEPURE Refrigerator Water Filter, Compatible with LG LT700P, Kenmore 9690, ADQ36006101, ADQ36006102, 46-9690, LFXC24726S, LFXS24623S, LFXS30766S, RFC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vhVgb3LDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️Authoritative Certifications- ICEPURE RWF1200A replacement for LG LT700P refrigerator water filter bears major Authoritative Certifications on markets, such as NSF/ANSI 42 & 372 Lead-Free from NSF and IAPMO, European Food Grade Regulations EC-1935/2016, ROHS, REACH, BPA-Free, TUV and Australian Water Mark. ❄️Efficient Filtration Capacity- ICEPURE RWF1200A refrigerator water filter replacement for LG ADQ36006101 and Kenmore Elite 9690 reduces many harmful substances from your water including 99% of Chlorine, taste, odor, THM, VOCs, Particles and all other major impurities, significantly improving the taste of drinking water to provide pure-tasting water, while retaining minerals beneficial to the human body. ❄️Premium Materials- BPA-free and food-grade materials. This filter is made from advanced natural coconut shell carbon and is Certified by Authoritative organizations for Material. The Outer layer is 0.5 Micron, ensuring better filtration. The carbon blocks have been independently tested by a third-party laboratory to remove heavy metals, large sediments, and all other dangerous impurities. ❄️Compatible Models- ICEPURE LT700P filter compatible with LG LT700P, LT700PC, ADQ36006101, ADQ36006101-S, ADQ36006102, KENMORE 46-9690, 469690, 9690, FML-3, R-9690, WSL-3, LFXC24726S, LFXS24623S, LFX28968ST, LFXS29766S, AQF-LT700P, LFX31925ST, WD-LT700P, AQF-LT700P, LFX31945ST, LFX21976ST, LFX31925SB, LFXS30766S, LFXC24726D, EP-LT700P, NP LT700P, Tier1 RWF1052, AWF-LT700P, K&J KJ700, Pure Line PL-500, FilterLogic FL-RF32, Waterspecialist WS632C, Maxblue MB-LT700P. ❄️Great value for money- ICEPURE filters are made with Premium materials, Efficient Filtration, Authoritative Certifications and advanced technologies. ❄️High standards- ICEPURE water filters use US technology and teams. The ICEPURE brand has high requirements for products, and every product that is manufactured must go through 5 inspection and testing stages，ensuring that every product meets our high expectations. ❄️Leak-free Design- ICEPURE filters use advanced and precise measurement technology, combined with 3D multi-dimensional design technology to ensure that our products fully match the original products and do not leak water. ❄️Experienced and professional - ICEPURE is a professional brand that is committed to the water treatment industry. For the past 20 years, Our products have been sold all over the world, and countless families have used or products as their solution. ❄️Easy to Replace- This filter can easily be installed without tools. For optimum performance we recommended that you change your filter every 6 months or 200 gallons, whichever comes first, this will vary based on your water quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vhVgb3LDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICEPURE","source_asin":"B0117DDQFE","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0117DDQFE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0117DDQFE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
