window.products.push({"id":118741,"name":"LG 6501KW2001B 6501KW2001A Sensor Kenmore Washer Motor Rotor Position AP5973402 Assembly Part WM1815CS WM1814CW WM1812CW WM1333HW WD-3274RHD WD-3245RH","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lRJH0IT3S._SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Rotor Position Sensor 6501kw2001b - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers 6501KW2001A, AP5973402, 3282954, 6501KW2001D, PS11706506. 6501kw2001a Rotor Position Sensor is compatible with LG and Kenmore appliances. 6501kw2001a Kenmore Rotor Position Sensor tracks the rotation direction and speed of the rotor and relays the data to the electronic control board. 6501kw2001a Lg Washer Motor Sensor fits hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Kenmore Part 6501kw2001a? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Lg Electronics 6501kw2001a Washer Motor Sensor will help if your appliance pumps but does not spin, does not agitate, does not start, or spins slowly. Before starting the repair, remember to turn off the power to your washer. 💡The Lg 6501kw2001a Rotor Position Sensor is a vital component of a washer that helps to detect the position of the rotor in the motor. It is also known as a Hall Sensor or Motor Position Sensor. Kenmore Washer Part 6501kw2001a is responsible for sending signals to the control board, which then coordinates the motor's speed and direction of rotation. 6501kw2001b Washer Sensor meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Is the Hall Sensor 6501kw2001a universal part? No, the Lg Hall Sensor 6501kw2001a is not universal. Different washer's models and brands use different rotor position sensor switches, which may have different specifications, sizes, and shapes. It is important to ensure that you purchase a replacement sensor switch that is compatible with your specific washer model and brand. Installing an incompatible sensor switch can result in malfunctioning or even damage to your washing machine. 💡 How long does it take to install the 6501kw2001b Lg Sensor Assembly? The time it takes to install a 6501kw2001b Lg Washer Motor Sensor in a washing machine can vary depending on the experience level of the person performing the installation, as well as the specific model of the washing machine. In general the replacement process can take anywhere from 30 minutes to a few hours, depending on the complexity of the machine and the difficulty of accessing the sensor switch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lRJH0IT3S._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07VHBDSCN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VHBDSCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VHBDSCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
