window.products.push({"id":118815,"name":"Countertop Nugget Ice Maker, 30lbs Per Day, Restaurant Quality Ice in 10 Minutes, Self-Cleaning Pebble Ice Maker Machine w/ 3Qt Water Reservoir, Stain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PFfnl359L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quality Nugget Ice At Home: FOHERE nugget ice maker provides restaurant-quality, addictively chewable nugget ice in your kitchen, home, or office instead of you driving to chain stores. The softer airy pebble ice won't affect your dental health. Soft pellet ice can fill the entire glass and cool drinks faster, absorbing drinks' flavor, and bringing fantastic tastes. Never Run Out of Ice: Powerful compressor plus a 3Qt water tank allows the FOHERE nugget ice maker to produce up to 30 lbs of ice per day. Making ice within ONLY 12 minutes, plus an ice basket that holds up to 5.3 lbs, you are never going to run out of ice. Self-Cleaning: The FOHERE pebble ice maker machine countertop provides a self-cleaning function to prevent limescale and odors. Simply press the 'CLEAN' button for 3s to start the cleaning cycles, and ensure you can enjoy healthy and fresh nugget ice at any time. Easy to Use: There's no learning curve here! Latest nugget ice-making technology, self-explanatory control panel, intelligible indicator lights, translucent lid, lightweight body, small footprint, stainless steel housing, and more. No installation is required. Everything for a better experience. Keep Ice & Worry-free Service: Thick insulation layer and double-layer lid prevent ice from melting fast. The ice retention rate every 12h is 70% at 80℉ of ambient temperature. [NOTE]: The ice basket is not refrigerated, so transfer ice to your freezer for long-term storage. 7*24-hour customer service and 12 months of after-sale service; Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PFfnl359L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOHERE","source_asin":"B0BHWDZMMK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118815","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHWDZMMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHWDZMMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
