window.products.push({"id":118870,"name":"WR51X10055 Defrost Heater Replacement Part For GE & Kenmore Refrigerators – Replaces WR51X10030 AP3183311","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6181R-VKJSL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"The WR51X10055 Defrost Heater keeps the cooling coils from frosting over. The heater will get hot and melt any ice or frost build up around the coils.Works with the following models: Kenmore 36358892894, Kenmore 36358072896, Kenmore 36350622000, Kenmore 36358892898, Kenmore 36358895897, etc. Replaces part numbers: WR51X10030, AP3183311, PS303781. Works with most top name brands: General Electric, Hotpoint, Kenmore Fixes the following symptoms: Fridge too warm Freezer section too warm Freezer not defrosting Frost buildup Count on our WR51X10055 Refrigerator Defrost Heater Replacement part for an unrivaled mix of durability, convenient functionality, and great value for money. Save your time and money now! SPECIFICATIONS: Product Name: Defrost Heater and Bracket Assembly  Color: As the picture shown  Material: Metal  Type: Defrost Heater  Defrost Heater has: Quartz Tube  Part Number: WR51X10055 Package Include: 1 x Defrost Heater (as pictures show)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6181R-VKJSL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vicue","source_asin":"B07R5LY3DF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R5LY3DF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R5LY3DF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":118871,"name":"8318084 Washer Lid Switch Assembly Part for Whirlpool Kenmore Maytag Washers Replace # WP8318084 ER8318084 1018522 AP6012742 PS11745957","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51APXuDXqwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Instructions: The washer lid switch is located on the washer doorframe. The purpose of the lid switch is to stop the washer from operating while the door lid is open. The pin on the lid pushes on the lever of the lid switch to tell the machine that the lid is closed. This part includes the grounding wire. If your machine is having trouble starting, is not agitating, spinning, or is not draining properly, this could be because the lid switch has broken. You will need a 5/16-inch nut driver for this repair. The package will contain one lid switch. You will need to access the back of the washer, and remove the two Phillips screws that hold the top back panel in place. Slide the panel forward to release. Use your nut driver to loosen the screw that holds the ground wire in place. Lift the lid of the washer to release the old lid switch. This part works with the following brands: Whirlpool, Kenmore, Maytag, Roper, Inglis, Estate, Amana, Crosley, Admiral, KitchenAid, Magic Chef This part fixes the following symptoms: Will Not Start Will not agitate Timer will not advance Pumps but will not spin Notes: Always disconnect the power supply when working on washers and other electrical appliances. This washer lid switch 8318084 can easily be damaged or you can be electrocuted if the electricity is not disconnected when replacing the lid switch. Wear work gloves to protect your hands Specification: Brand: KONDUONE Condition: 100% Brand New and never used Package Includes: 1 x 8318084 Washer Lid Switch assembly KONDUONE always offer the best customer service to his customers.If you have any problem about your order,please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51APXuDXqwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KONDUONE","source_asin":"B07MM8FDTM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MM8FDTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MM8FDTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
