window.products.push({"id":118891,"name":"54mm Bottomless Naked Portafilter | Filter Basket Included | Fits 54mm Breville Barista Series and 54mm Breville Machines | Sandalwood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EvwKGzFHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The key to a perfect shot of espresso is consistency. The quickest way to consistency is to control as many variables in your prep process as possible. This 54mm Bottomless Naked Portafilter he Game Changer for Perfect Extraction Bottomless (aka naked) portafilters are an essential tool for identifying and correcting extraction problems that cannot be seen with standard spouted portafilters. Allowing you to watch the entire extraction process. Plus, who doesn't love seeing those beautiful tiger stripes? This 54mm bottomless portafilter was designed to work with the Breville/Sage Barista Express, Barista Express Impress, Barista Pro, Barista Touch, Bambino, Bambino Plus, Infuser and Duo-Temp Pro. Double-shot, single wall filter basket included. PLEASE NOTE: Channeling and spurting can be very messy, but are EXTREMELY common. This is not a defect of the portafilter itself, but instead is your coffee telling you that there's room for improvement in your preparation process (grind size, tamping, distribution, etc).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EvwKGzFHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LISM","source_asin":"B088136YXT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088136YXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088136YXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
