window.products.push({"id":118976,"name":"NRP 12-14cup Permanent Coffee Filter Screen Bottom Basket Replacement for Filter Coffeemaker with Large Brew Section","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419cObx95LL._AC_.jpg","description":"NRP Universal Fit replacement gold-tone basket coffee filter for partial model of the Classic American Drip CoffeeMakers. Manufactured from surgical grade woven stainless-steel mesh, this filter is dishwasher safety & reusable at least 300 time use per filter. Herbal coffee brews best in a permanent filter because the small particulates in its grind tend to drip more slowly through paper, especially the cocoa powder. Support our forests, the lungs of our planet, by switching to permanent filters. No more worry about paper bleaches or destroying forests! You'll never run out of paper filters again. Easy to clean: Rinse under running water or clean in the dishwasher after emptying grounds. To use: Simply place in the filter holder and fill with ground coffee. Lets the coffee flavor through for richer tasting coffee. Helps eliminate the need for paper filters.  Screen Bottom: Window style mesh on the bottom of the coffee filter allows the coffee's flavors & oils get through the pot. and it's not easy to cause overflow in the drip filtration process.Compatible Coffeemaker List; including but no limit to: Mr.Coffee partial newer models with 12-14 cup capacity KitchenAid KCM11GTF 12cup Models, like as KCM111OB/KCM1202OB/KCM1204OB/KCM1203CU...etc Partial Hamilton Beach 12-14cup models / B+D: Partail 12-cup model Ca'presso: partial 12-cup models. Sal ton: 14-cup modelBella: 14-cup model Under NRP supervision and Manufactured in the China. This is not a OEM product and is not covered under any Coffee Brands manufacturer's warranty. Please check your manufacturer's warranty regarding the use of non-OEM parts. Any referenced Brand Names and LOGOs are the registered trademarks of their respective owners.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419cObx95LL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NRP Neutral Replacement Parts","source_asin":"B08F4YKRHJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-118976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F4YKRHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F4YKRHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
